#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:7
msgid "Projects panel"
msgstr "项目面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:9
msgid ""
"The projects panel displays the opened projects trees, `folios`_ and "
"`embedded title blocks`_. The `QET`_ and `user`_ collection title blocks are"
" also displayed at the projects panel."
msgstr ""
"项目面板显示已打开项目的树状结构、`图幅 <folios_>`_ 和 `嵌入式图框 <embedded title blocks_>`_ 。`QET "
"<QET_>`_ 和 `用户 <user_>`_ 集合的图框也会显示在项目面板中。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Projects panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:17
msgid "To display or hidden the projects panel:"
msgstr "要显示或隐藏项目面板："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:19
msgid "Select **Settings > Display > Projects** menu item."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 项目** 菜单项。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:21
msgid "The tasks which can be done from projects panels are:"
msgstr "项目面板可以完成的任务有："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:23
msgid ""
"Manage `folios`_ (Add folios, define folio order at each project, etc.)."
msgstr "管理 `图幅 <folios_>`_ （添加图幅、定义每个项目中图幅的顺序等）。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:24
msgid "Manage the `embedded title blocks`_ from the project."
msgstr "管理项目中的 `嵌入式图框 <embedded title blocks_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:25
msgid "Manage the default `QET`_ title block collection."
msgstr "管理默认的 `QET <QET_>`_ 图框集合。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:26
msgid "Manage the `user`_ title block collection."
msgstr "管理 `用户 <user_>`_ 图框集合。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:27
msgid "Define the active project."
msgstr "定义活动项目。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:28
msgid "Define the active folio which should be displayed at the `workspace`_."
msgstr "定义应在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中显示的活动图幅。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:29
msgid "Display the folio properties PopUp window."
msgstr "显示图幅属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:30
msgid "Display the project properties PopUp window."
msgstr "显示项目属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/projects_panel.rst:32
msgid ""
"To make easier the work with the project panel, QElectroTech provides a "
"filter. All `folios`_, `projects`_ and `title blocks`_ without a name or "
"part of a string can be hidden."
msgstr ""
"为便于使用项目面板，QElectroTech 提供了过滤器。所有没有名称或不包含指定字符串的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 、`项目 "
"<projects_>`_ 和 `图框 <title blocks_>`_ 都可以隐藏。"
